{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_077B90","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"我接下来要去哥斯达黎加。那是一片陌生的土地，而且还是CIA的绝密任务。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"没人能保证我活着回来，其中也包括被CIA亲手灭口的风险。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"所以我想把这一切记录下来。也为了她……The Boss的名誉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"从小，我就喜欢仰望星空。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"太阳落山后，我会走到外面，吸一口冰冷的空气。月亮、金星，还有无限远方的群星。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"在曼彻斯特，很少有机会看到满天繁星。但那已经足以点燃我的憧憬。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"即使有时还要害怕德军的空袭，我仍会仰望天空，梦想有一天能抵达那里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不过，这其中也有很现实的原因。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我的皮肤很脆弱。只要稍微晒到太阳，就会又红又肿。白天在外面玩更是想都别想。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"自然而然，我只能在夜里外出。因此几乎没有机会和同龄孩子一起玩，但我也不觉得寂寞。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"他们的思维不合逻辑，却又单纯，很容易预测。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"男孩会聊坦克、飞机、稀奇的虫子；女孩会聊漂亮的裙子、点心、玻璃珠，还有自己喜欢的男孩……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"说到底，我和他们根本聊不到一起。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"更让人无奈的是，成年人其实也没什么不同。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"不合逻辑，又单纯。尤其是男人。随着年纪增长，脑子里就全是女人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"幸运的是，我似乎很有数学天赋。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"十岁左右，我就会去附近的Turing博士家，和他讨论数理逻辑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"因为就算到了深夜，博士家里也总亮着灯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"“理论上，”博士说，“任何算法都应该能由计算机实现。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"Turing博士没其他男人那么愚蠢。至于原因，我是在他死后才知道的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"“总有一天，计算机会拥有智能。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"这个想法深深打动了我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"数学天赋让我离星空更近了一步。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"跳级，赴美留学。后来我还在<R=加州理工学院,CALTECH>就读时，NASA成立了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=加州理工学院,CALTECH>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"我毫不犹豫地报名了。当时我已经算得上是一名计算机工程师，而NASA正需要这种技术。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"工作很愉快。那时我已经放弃亲自去太空的梦想，但只要能参与其中，我就很开心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"我被分配到Mercury计划。那是为了与苏联竞争而进行的载人航天计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"七名男子被选为飞行员候选人。他们被称为“Original 7”，一夜之间成了名人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"计划总体进行得很顺利。资金充足，资料也应有尽有。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"甚至还有近似Sputnik设计图的资料，也不知道究竟是怎么解析出来的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"我们以为，赶上苏联只是时间问题。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"他们已经把狗送入卫星轨道并安全带回。但高层认为，那只不过是一次偶然的成功。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"美国主要在海上回收再入舱。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"但苏联所接壤的海域大多属于北冰洋，他们只能让再入舱在陆地着陆。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"狗还好说，要让人类安全返回，应该还需要一段时间。我们当时是这么认为的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"1961年1月底，我们成功完成了一次载着黑猩猩的弹道飞行。那只名叫Ham的猩猩平安归来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"就在NASA沉浸于成功的喜悦时，一名女性前来赴任。据说她既是备用飞行员，也是顾问。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"漂亮的金发，刚毅的嘴角，严厉的目光。但那双眼睛深处，又带着慈爱的光。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"她就是The Boss。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":20,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"她瞥了一眼沉浸在庆祝气氛中的我们，低声说道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"“趁今天好好品味<R=喜悦,JOY>吧。因为从明天开始，你们就要面对真相了。”","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=喜悦,JOY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"她说中了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"第二天，我们被告知计划必须大幅提前。最新情报显示，苏联距离载人飞行只剩几个月。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"高层的判断错了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":44,"cn_text":"我们绝不能再制造第二次Sputnik震撼。无论如何，都必须抢在苏联之前把人送上太空。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":45,"cn_text":"这根本是不可能完成的命令。我们才刚让猩猩完成第一次飞行。既然要载人，就不能用一句“失败了”来收场。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":147,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":46,"cn_text":"如果坐进去的还是被当作英雄的“Original 7”，那就更不允许失败。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":47,"cn_text":"偏偏高层还要求在飞船上加一扇窗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":48,"cn_text":"他们说，飞行员不是实验动物。等“英雄”平安归来后，还得让他亲口讲述从太空看到的景色。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":49,"cn_text":"简直胡来。硬给现有飞船加窗，结构强度就无法保证，而且宇宙射线屏蔽也会出问题。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":50,"cn_text":"但The Boss很好地回应了这些要求。她明明对航天是外行，却只听我们讲了一遍就理解了状况。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":122,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":51,"cn_text":"她很严格，对自己严格，对别人也严格。甚至显得有些冷酷。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":52,"cn_text":"可我还是被她吸引了。她很美，更重要的是，她非常睿智。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":53,"cn_text":"她的思维彻底理性，可我偏偏无法预测她会怎么行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":54,"cn_text":"我很容易就能想象，她的判断源自她庞大的<R=知识,KNOWLEDGE>库。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=知识,KNOWLEDGE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":55,"cn_text":"简单来说，她经历过比任何人都更多样、更严酷的事情。那种广度，在我看来近乎无限。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":56,"cn_text":"我在她的内心，看见了另一片星空。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":57,"cn_text":"也许因为同为女性，她愿意和我亲近。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":58,"cn_text":"即使我无法走进阳光，她也会照亮我，像柔和的月光一样。那时的我很幸福。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":59,"cn_text":"在她准确的建议下，计划一步步得到修正。只有一件事例外——飞行员的安全。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":60,"cn_text":"到了挑选飞行员那天，“Original 7”全都默默起身离席。这也难怪，风险实在太大了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":61,"cn_text":"就算他们主动请缨，NASA高层也不会允许。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":55,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":62,"cn_text":"他们是站在媒体聚光灯下的国家英雄，不可能把这种任务强加给他们。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":63,"cn_text":"寂静的会议室里，The Boss缓缓举起了手。仿佛这一切早已决定好了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""}]}